	"Description": "The only Unreal AI bridge that checks its work. Build and verify Blueprints, Animation Blueprints, and full character rigs — from graph logic through skeletal mesh, physics, and IK — with real compile-error and pin-connection checks, not guesses. Works with Claude, GPT, or any WebSocket/MCP-capable AI agent. Requires EnhancedInput and PythonScriptPlugin (both included with Unreal Engine - no separate installation needed).",
